Card Distribution:
Action: Game starts
Expected:
    24 treasure cards distributed across players
    No duplicate treasure cards across all hands
    Each player gets the same amount of cards

Treasure Spawning:
Action: Treasure cards done generating
Expected:
    Each treasure card get a corresponding treasure on the board
    Treasure is evenly distributed

Treasure Spawning Constraints:
Action: Treasure spawned
    Only one treasure on a given square
    No treasures on any corner tiles
    Every treasure type spawns exactly once

Wrong Treasure:
Action: Player lands on square with treasure they don't need
Expected:
    Player does not collect treasure

Correct Treasure:
Action: Player lands on square with treasure they do need
Expected:
    Collect treasure
    Remove treasure from the board
    Treasure is marked as collected

Correct Treasure Already Collected:
Action: Player lands on treasure after already collecting it
Expected:
    Nothing happens


Collecting Final Treasure:
Action: Player collects their last required treasure
Expected:
    All treasures marked collected
    Player is not declared winner yet
    Player must return to starting tile

Win Condition:
Action: Player has all treasure and lands on their starting square
Expected:
    Player wins game
    Game ends correctly

Player Returns Early:
Action: Player returns to their starting square before collecting all treasure
Expected:
    No win is granted

Death With Collected Treasures
Action: Player dies after collecting treasure
Expected:
    One random collected treasure is uncollected
    Player must recollect it
    Renaming collected treasures stay collected

Death With No Collected Treasure:
Action: Player dies before collecting treasure
Expected:
    No errors occur
    Treasure start remains unchanged
